  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Childhood Development support has been shown to unlock the academic and social potential of children. ORG&apos;s National Playdate program offers parenting skills and resources designed to stimulate early learning and family bonding in children in our underserved communities. The National Playdate program offers virtual and live events and resources that provide family fun and play through participation in the story, song, and craft activities.</narrative>
  </description>
